# LLM drafting of care-team replies (optional). Without VITE_LLM_API_URL the app uses the
# built-in rule-based drafter (endorsed library + policy pack) — every reply still waits for
# a clinician. Point VITE_LLM_API_URL at any OpenAI-compatible chat/completions endpoint;
# prefer a server-side proxy that injects the key, since a VITE_ var ships to the browser.
VITE_LLM_API_URL=
VITE_LLM_API_KEY=
VITE_LLM_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
